{"seq":1,"slug":"compression-limiting","title":"压缩与限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/compression-limiting","wordCount":1552,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"压缩与限制\">压缩与限制</h1><p>在母带阶段，压缩和限制是同一类工具——它们都在用增益对动态做手术——但承担的职责截然不同。总线压缩负责&quot;胶合&quot;：把整首歌里彼此分离的元素黏成一个有凝聚力的整体，并温和地驯服动态起伏。限制器负责&quot;封顶&quot;：把作品推到目标响度，同时像一道不可逾越的墙挡住峰值，确保不会超过真峰值天花板。一个塑形，一个把关，混淆它们的角色是母带新手最常见的失误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动态处理器的行为由几个共通参数决定：阈值（threshold）、压缩比（ratio）、启动时间（attack）、释放时间（release）、拐点（knee）。理解它们如何协同，才能解释为什么同样是&quot;压缩&quot;，总线压缩听起来是&quot;胶合&quot;、限制器听起来是&quot;封顶&quot;。</p>\n<p>下图展示一条信号穿过压缩器再穿过限制器时增益是如何被控制的：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[输入信号&lt;br/&gt;动态起伏大] --&gt; B[总线压缩&lt;br/&gt;低比 2:1, 慢启动]&#10;  B --&gt; C{超过阈值?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[温和衰减 1-2 dB&lt;br/&gt;胶合整体]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[原样通过]&#10;  D --&gt; F[音色性塑形]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[限制器&lt;br/&gt;极高比, 极快启动]&#10;  G --&gt; H{触及天花板?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[硬性削峰&lt;br/&gt;守 -1 dBTP]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[原样通过]&#10;  I --&gt; K[输出: 达标响度]&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[输入信号&lt;br/&gt;动态起伏大] --&gt; B[总线压缩&lt;br/&gt;低比 2:1, 慢启动]\n  B --&gt; C{超过阈值?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[温和衰减 1-2 dB&lt;br/&gt;胶合整体]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[原样通过]\n  D --&gt; F[音色性塑形]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[限制器&lt;br/&gt;极高比, 极快启动]\n  G --&gt; H{触及天花板?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[硬性削峰&lt;br/&gt;守 -1 dBTP]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[原样通过]\n  I --&gt; K[输出: 达标响度]\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>压缩比是区分两者的关键。总线压缩用低比（常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），意思是输入每超阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> dB，输出只增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dB——这是温和的&quot;按摩&quot;。限制器本质是压缩比趋于无穷的极端压缩（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），意思是无论输入多大，输出都不超过设定的天花板——这是绝对的&quot;墙&quot;。形式上，超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，压缩后的输出为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = T + \\frac{x - T}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是压缩比。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y \\to T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，这就是限制器。</p>\n<p>下表把母带中三类动态处理的角色、典型设置和位置讲清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理器</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>典型比 / 设置</th>\n<th>链中位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总线压缩</td>\n<td>胶合 + 温和控动态</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span><del><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，慢启动，GR 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></del><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> dB</td>\n<td>修正 EQ 之后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多段压缩</td>\n<td>局部动态（如低频独立）</td>\n<td>按段设置</td>\n<td>见<a href=\"../spectral/multiband-processing\">多段处理</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限制器</td>\n<td>推响度 + 守峰值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，极快启动，天花板 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP</td>\n<td>链路倒数第二</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总线压缩-胶合的艺术\">总线压缩：胶合的艺术</h2><p>总线压缩的目标不是&quot;压得明显&quot;，而是&quot;压得几乎听不出来、却让整首歌更黏&quot;。它的招牌做法是慢启动、自动或中速释放、低压缩比，让瞬态（鼓的冲击）先穿过去再被压缩跟上，从而保留冲击力，同时把整体的能量&quot;抱&quot;在一起。</p>\n<p>启动时间是这里的灵魂。如果启动太快，压缩器会在鼓的瞬态一出现就死死压住，结果鼓变软、整首歌失去冲击；启动慢一点，让前几毫秒的瞬态溜过去，再开始压缩，鼓就既有冲击又被收拢。释放时间则要与歌曲速度（节拍）呼应：释放过慢会让压缩&quot;喘不过气&quot;、动态长期被摁住；释放与节拍同步则会产生一种随音乐&quot;呼吸&quot;的泵感（pumping），用得好是律动，用过头是瑕疵。</p>\n<p>判断总线压缩是否到位，仍要遵守<a href=\"../foundations/mastering-chain\">母带信号链</a>里强调的等响 A/B：旁通压缩、补偿增益、盲听——若打开压缩后只是&quot;更响&quot;而不是&quot;更黏&quot;，那就是没调对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限制器-响度的最后一道关卡\">限制器：响度的最后一道关卡</h2><p>限制器是整条链上最不可逆、责任最重的环节。它同时做两件事：把整体响度推到目标值（如流媒体的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS，或更激进风格的更响），以及守住真峰值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP。后者至关重要——流媒体把母带编码成 AAC/MP3 时，编码过程会引入采样点之间的&quot;内部采样峰值&quot;（inter-sample peak），可能比你在 DAW 里看到的样本峰值高出近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dB；如果你顶到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> dBFS，编码后就会削波失真。所以限制器要用真峰值（true peak）模式，把天花板设在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP，给编码留出余量。这条标准在<a href=\"lufs-loudness\">响度标准 LUFS</a>里有更系统的展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[限制前: 样本峰值看似 -0.3] --&gt; B[流媒体 AAC 编码]&#10;  B --&gt; C[内部采样峰值&lt;br/&gt;可能 +0.9 dB]&#10;  C --&gt; D{超过 0 dBFS?}&#10;  D --&gt;|顶到 0 dBFS| E[编码后削波失真]&#10;  D --&gt;|留 -1 dBTP 余量| F[安全, 无失真]\">flowchart TD\n  A[限制前: 样本峰值看似 -0.3] --&gt; B[流媒体 AAC 编码]\n  B --&gt; C[内部采样峰值&lt;br/&gt;可能 +0.9 dB]\n  C --&gt; D{超过 0 dBFS?}\n  D --&gt;|顶到 0 dBFS| E[编码后削波失真]\n  D --&gt;|留 -1 dBTP 余量| F[安全, 无失真]</pre><p>限制器的&quot;推&quot;也有代价。推得越狠，增益衰减越多，瞬态被削得越平，作品的动态范围就越小。这就引出了母带最核心的张力：响度 vs 动态。把这件事讲透是<a href=\"dynamic-range-musicality\">动态范围与音乐性</a>的任务，这里只点明：限制器是这场权衡的执行者，&quot;该推到多响&quot;不是技术问题，而是音乐判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与参数对照\">常见误区与参数对照</h2><p>母带压缩/限制最常踩的坑，集中在&quot;用错工具解决错问题&quot;。下表把几个高频误区列出来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用限制器做胶合</td>\n<td>瞬态被削平、音乐失去呼吸</td>\n<td>胶合交给低比总线压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用总线压缩硬推响度</td>\n<td>泵感失控、染色过重</td>\n<td>响度交给限制器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限制器不开真峰值模式</td>\n<td>编码后削波</td>\n<td>始终用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP 真峰值天花板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不做增益匹配就 A/B</td>\n<td>把&quot;更响&quot;误判为&quot;更好&quot;</td>\n<td>等响盲听（见<a href=\"../foundations/mastering-chain\">母带信号链</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为修混音问题狂压</td>\n<td>越压越糟</td>\n<td>退回混音（见<a href=\"../foundations/role-and-goals\">母带处理的角色与目标</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中还要注意：压缩和限制都会与 EQ 互相影响。压缩会改变频谱平衡（被压后释放的高频会更突出），所以音色性 EQ 常放在压缩之后；而某些工程师会在限制器前用一个&quot;动态 EQ&quot;只在低频过冲时收一下，避免低频独占限制器的增益衰减——这属于<a href=\"../spectral/multiband-processing\">多段处理</a>的范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>母带的压缩与限制角色分明：总线压缩&quot;胶合&quot;（低比、慢启动、GR 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>~<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> dB），限制器&quot;封顶&quot;（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\infty{:}1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、极快启动、守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP）。</li>\n<li>限制器是压缩比趋于无穷的极端形态：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = T + (x-T)/R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 输出被钳在天花板。</li>\n<li>总线压缩的灵魂是启动时间（放过瞬态保冲击）与释放时间（随节拍呼吸）；判断好坏靠等响 A/B。</li>\n<li>限制器必须用真峰值模式守 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP，否则流媒体 AAC 编码的内部采样峰值会导致削波。</li>\n<li>&quot;推到多响&quot;是响度与动态的权衡，技术上由限制器执行、音乐上需判断，详见<a href=\"dynamic-range-musicality\">动态范围与音乐性</a>与<a href=\"lufs-loudness\">响度标准 LUFS</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"压缩与限制","id":"压缩与限制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"总线压缩：胶合的艺术","id":"总线压缩-胶合的艺术"},{"level":2,"text":"限制器：响度的最后一道关卡","id":"限制器-响度的最后一道关卡"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与参数对照","id":"常见误区与参数对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"母带信号链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/foundations/mastering-chain"},"next":{"title":"响度标准 LUFS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/lufs-loudness"}}